Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:28.13,main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,More...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:31.17,main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,More.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.34,0:00:33.73,main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Give me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:08.89,sign_harsh_red,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(469.848,284.611)\fade(400,400\blur1)}The Have-Nots
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.29,main,Coachman,0,0,0,,Somebody! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:36.80,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.04,main,Coachman,0,0,0,,Warriors? I-I'm saved...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:40.69,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,We'll take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.68,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,If you see one goblin,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.89,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,there's a hundred more around!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:02.02,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:03.61,main,Warriors,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:19.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm starving...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:24.43,main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,I finally hit Level 6 \Nafter today's goblin hunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:26.93,main,Lady Warrior,0,0,0,,Well, there were a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.89,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,And we made off with quite a haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:31.02,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,Let's cash out and then split the take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.82,main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.95,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Goblin hunting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.51,0:03:39.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That'll never be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:43.82,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm useless, with a stomach that \Nnever stops growling, to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:47.54,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,All thanks to this worthless skill...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:47.20,sign_harsh_red,Skill signs,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000100&\fade(400,1)\an7\pos(53.486,96.248)}[Stats]
