Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.33,0:03:48.79,sign_harsh_red,Skill signs,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fs30\pos(563.149,261.642)}[Gluttony]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.50,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Guess I should be grateful \Nto even have a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:57.77,main,Girl,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks for coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:01.67,main,Merchant,0,0,0,,The holy knights are coming through...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.76,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,It's that trio of Vlerick siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:16.80,main,Merchant,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly sorry, \NSir Hado, let me just—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.57,main,Hado,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing \Nto my boots, you wretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.43,main,Merchant,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:24.46,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You're talking back? To me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:29.62,main,Memil,0,0,0,,You must know what happens \Nif you insult holy knights, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.14,0:04:31.91,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Your head comes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.12,main,Merchant,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:38.59,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Hado, Memil, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.47,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:41.73,main,Merchant,0,0,0,,Y-yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:43.78,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.16,0:04:46.18,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Very lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.56,0:04:49.81,main,Propritress,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:51.62,main,Propritress,0,0,0,,That was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:57.77,main,Warrior Boss,0,0,0,,Unbelievable. Hard to believe that \NLady Roxy is a holy knight like that lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:04.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Shift's almost over. \NJust gotta make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.45,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Hey, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:12.21,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Have you done a proper job \Nfilling in for us today?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.65,0:05:14.55,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir Rafale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:16.87,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Is that right? In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:21.70,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,That's your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:23.88,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:36.92,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Sorry! You were so filthy, \NI didn't notice you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:40.96,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Absolutely pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.96,0:05:45.74,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,That noisy gut makes it seem \Nlike we don't keep you fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.74,0:05:49.70,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You trying to embarrass the Vlerick family?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.73,0:05:53.66,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,In this world, there are haves...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.44,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,and there are have-nots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:00.16,main,Hado,0,0,0,,You useless maggot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:03.98,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What separates them...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:07.05,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Who do you owe your livelihood to, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.51,0:06:10.25,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Someone with a worthless skill like yours
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.25,0:06:13.73,main,Memil,0,0,0,,is only earning money thanks to \Nthe grace of holy knights like us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.59,main,Memil,0,0,0,,You should be so grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:21.71,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,...are the special powers \Nbestowed by the gods: skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:28.87,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,When you slack off, it reflects \Npoorly on us, your employers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.87,0:06:30.15,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,On your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:34.41,main,Hado,0,0,0,,Come on! Get up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.41,0:06:36.95,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,I believe he needs to be taught a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:40.50,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,Defiant dogs need strict \Ndiscipline, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:43.58,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:50.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Inflicting that kind of abuse on \Nthe citizens we're sworn to protect...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.77,0:06:53.11,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,It is not the act of a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:55.18,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Roxy Hart...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:59.29,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Watching the gate is an \Nhonorable duty for a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:02.60,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,A duty that should be your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:06.90,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,It is also the duty of holy knights to \Nprovide employment for the have-nots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.82,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You claim kind of treatment is necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:15.06,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,This amounts to a difference \Nin professional opinion, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:18.09,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us. Come along, Hado, Memil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:29.84,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate... are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.68,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.26,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Rafale...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.35,0:07:41.48,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Stay still, please. You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.12,0:07:45.42,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:48.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:51.52,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,We're cohorts when it \Ncomes to watching the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:55.00,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Besides, this is how a holy knight \Nshould conduct themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:57.12,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for me to relieve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.14,0:08:08.00,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,If this kind of thing happens again,\N please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.36,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:16.57,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm used to it. If you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:29.83,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:35.53,flashback,Roxy,0,0,0,,If this kind of thing happens again,\N please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:38.78,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I know what Lady Roxy said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:46.07,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,but with how he is,\Nthere's no telling what he might do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.17,0:08:50.04,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't risk getting her involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.55,0:08:52.52,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,They knock you around again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:57.84,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,If this keeps up... you're gonna \Nend up like the last guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:09:01.26,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,Endless abuse, brutal labor...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:05.31,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,There's only one outcome for that,\Nand it's a nasty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal, barkeep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:17.57,main,Barkeep,0,0,0,,I'll be praying you don't end up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:23.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Stupid useless Gluttony...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:31.46,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I wish I could've been born \Nwith something worthwhile, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:34.52,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm not asking to be a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:38.52,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'd take being a warrior, or even \Na merchant or a craftsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.91,0:09:43.43,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But... there's no changing how things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.43,0:09:45.89,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,When you have nothing, \Nyou're trapped as a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:50.90,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thieves?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:53.05,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I need to let Lady Roxy know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:55.57,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You're certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:59.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah! I saw them myself. There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:00.92,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'll need to apprehend them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:04.21,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Please, take over here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.21,0:10:06.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right. Good luck, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:08.35,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.79,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Appearances aside, \NI'm quite confident in my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:27.06,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is it over...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:38.08,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy trusted me with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:43.38,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,If I run, it'll cause trouble for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.92,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.46,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,He's already injured...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:55.59,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Even I can handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:14.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:19.09,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated. \NIncreasing stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:23.82,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Skills Identify and Telepathy \Nhave been added.
