Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:27.77,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My Gluttony skill... activated?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:36.92,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What in the world was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:38.68,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:47.43,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate, are you all right? Were you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:50.89,italics,Roxy,0,0,0,,He doesn't look well. It's worrying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:53.65,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Is anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:58.61,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,That was just like... \NI could hear her inner voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:00.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I'm not hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.62,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.84,italics,Roxy,0,0,0,,What a relief. I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:04.95,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:08.53,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I need to report this to my superiors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:10.37,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.18,0:12:12.75,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't hear it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:14.58,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Fate? Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:19.41,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, right! You can take credit \Nfor all of this, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.41,0:12:22.21,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,But you slew one yourself, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:25.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,If Sir Rafale finds out about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:28.10,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,It would cause you problems, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:31.56,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't make trouble for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.56,0:12:37.57,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I understand, but without you, \NI would've failed in my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.44,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Please, let me show my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:40.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:41.99,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.01,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,She's not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:44.11,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.63,0:12:48.15,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Would you like to work for the Hart family?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:53.21,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Or do you intend to serve \Nthe Vlericks until it kills you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:56.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:58.67,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,You needn't worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:13:01.39,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Your future is yours to decide, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:05.63,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A future where I'm treated \Nlike trash by them...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.29,0:13:09.99,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Or a bright one where \NI can work for Lady Roxy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.60,0:13:13.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Still, if I quit, then whoever \Nreplaces me would...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:18.16,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,I told you. Defending the gate \Nis the duty of a holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:22.07,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, it won't \Nbe your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:26.05,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,If Lady Roxy thinks so, \Nthen it's probably true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:30.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It'd be my honor, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:32.95,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:36.46,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.80,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,My stats are in the triple digits now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(43.262,83.866)}[Stats]
