Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(42.897,168.458)}Strength:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(43.262,203.144)}Magic:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(43.262,242.211)}Spirit:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(43.627,277.261)}Agility:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,85.578)}[Skills]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,130.852)}Gluttony
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,169.919)}Identify
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.79,0:13:40.42,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,205.335)}Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:41.99,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:46.38,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And what's "Identify"? And "Telepathy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:50.51,flashback italics,Roxy,0,0,0,,He doesn't look well. It's worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait, was that Telepathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:55.93,flashback italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:14:02.32,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It actually activated...\N and what's going on with my body?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:09.58,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But with stats like this, \NI might be able to beat monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.62,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,Looking for a sword, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:23.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:25.61,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,What kind of budget are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:29.16,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:34.61,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,Great, you're poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:36.81,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,What a waste of hospitality...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:39.31,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,You can't buy a weapon with \Nthat kind of chump change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.31,0:14:41.19,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,It's been five years since \NI came to the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:44.86,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,These two silver coins are everything \NI've been able to save up by working...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:48.50,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,All you'll be able to afford are \Nthose trash weapons in the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.50,0:14:49.58,main,Customer,0,0,0,,I was curious about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:51.16,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,Oh, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:53.38,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's better than nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.60,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:01.08,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Zero for both durability and strength, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:04.56,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:05.83,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,This one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:08.06,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:25.77,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Filthy, and treated like trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:29.05,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,A lot like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:31.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:33.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It talked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:37.45,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure this sword just talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:41.33,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,"Greed. One-handed sword."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:45.93,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I'll make it worth your while, \Nso buy me, Gluttony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:49.48,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,How'd you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:52.03,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We have a lot in common, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:53.31,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,We do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.43,0:15:59.48,main,Customer,0,0,0,,This one looks good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.62,main,Stand Owner,0,0,0,,You have an eye for quality, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:08.36,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Did you hear the rumors, Rafale?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:11.93,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Roxy is apparently trying to \Nhire Fate for the Hart household
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:13.57,main,Memil,0,0,0,,without even asking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:18.24,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Let's teach her what happens \Nwhen you defy the Vlerick family!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:21.71,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,There's no shortage of replacements for Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:24.67,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,It's not worth the trouble, Memil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:28.63,main,Memil,0,0,0,,She was complaining about\N our handling of guard duty, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:33.79,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,The Harts and the Vlericks are part of the \Nfive great families that support the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:36.59,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,There's no point in \Ncomplicating that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:42.74,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,It's time I head to \Nthe military district, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.74,0:16:44.10,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:47.94,main,Memil,0,0,0,,What part of your studies \Nhas you so enthusiastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:53.30,main,Rafale,0,0,0,,The study of how to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:56.12,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Immortality...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.83,main,Memil,0,0,0,,Oh, Rafale, you don't have to tease me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:09.62,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,"Fate Graphite."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.62,0:17:10.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.80,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate Graphite...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.64,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Congratulations, I've learned your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Like that's some kind of favor...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:21.90,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Here they come, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.06,0:17:32.05,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated. \NIncreasing stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:34.56,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Skill Strength Boost has been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.56,0:17:35.75,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,It happened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Get a load of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:50.46,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I guess they were right about "When you see \None goblin, there's a hundred more around."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:51.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,A-A hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.21,0:17:57.32,main,Fate,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:00.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.44,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:09.00,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:12.24,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:27.93,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,More new skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(12.229,83.136)}[Stats]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(12.229,130.122)}Vitality:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(11.864,167.728)}Strength:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(12.229,202.414)}Magic:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(12.229,241.481)}Spirit:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(12.594,276.531)}Agility:
