Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,130.852)}Gluttony
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,169.919)}Identify
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(456.868,205.335)}Telepathy
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(536.823,239.655)}Strength\NBoost (Low)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.85,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(537.918,273.61)}Vitality\NBoost (Low)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:40.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You're probably filled up now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:45.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it... my stomach \Nhasn't growled even once today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:48.66,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's never happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:54.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But I thought you were born with \Nthe only skills you'd ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.50,0:18:57.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You can thank the Gluttony skill for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.15,0:19:01.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Normally, your stats increase from battles,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:04.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,and based on your experience, \Nyour level goes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:08.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,But the Gluttony skill \Nsteals stats and skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:11.56,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,at the cost of not \Nbenefiting from experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:14.46,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's why I'm still level one, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.76,0:19:19.45,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Because we're in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:20.55,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:31.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Your Gluttony skill isn't the kind of thing \Nyou want other people finding out about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:36.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,It's one of the skills that defy divine law.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:46.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So, I'd better do my fighting alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:47.77,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You've got me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:50.58,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Now that you're wielding me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:53.15,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,you're not alone anymore, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:55.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So, you accept me as your master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:57.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Whoa, there, let's not get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:59.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,But it's the truth, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:00.33,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.98,0:20:05.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I'll head back for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:09.72,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa! Collect those goblin ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:12.32,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You need to get paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.94,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't have killed all of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:27.74,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thirty eight goblins earns me three \Nsilver and eighty bronze coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.22,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That's enough for meat with dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:33.81,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hold it. My maintenance comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.81,0:20:36.01,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Do a proper job and treat me \Nlike the gem I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:37.96,main,Fate,0,0,0,,For a sword, you've got \Na real high opinion of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I didn't get the name Greed on accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.44,0:20:43.24,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Meat comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:44.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's been five years since—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.55,0:20:48.14,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:51.43,main,Sahara,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:54.85,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:01.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What are his skills...?
