Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:06.06,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The Conceal skill, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.06,0:21:09.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That keeps his skills from being \Nvisible, even against Identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,So there's no telling what he could do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.51,0:21:12.41,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:14.65,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What's your call, Fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:16.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:18.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can't just ignore this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.83,0:21:28.30,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You should be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.30,0:21:33.14,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,There's a place even worthless trash \Nlike you can serve some purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:37.48,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You're gonna be a toy for the holy knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.44,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Ain't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:46.61,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,Huh?! Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.61,0:21:49.46,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hold on. This guy's pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.46,0:21:51.26,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This is your last chance to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:53.26,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,I've finally got some kind of power...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:54.59,main,Kasim,0,0,0,,You scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:59.00,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,If someone's suffering in front \Nof me, I want to help them!
